docs {
  The workspace home screen: an overview in one read, plus the run-stats
  chart, credit usage and the pending-approvals queue behind it.

  `days` (1-365, default 30) sets the reporting window everywhere it's
  accepted; each response echoes it as `window: { days, starts_at, ends_at }`.
}
